1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,425
W: How did your team make out in the baseball tournament over the weekend?

2
00:00:04,335 --> 00:00:11,345
M: You're not going to believe this, but we made it all the way to the finals by beating the marketing team and then played the sales team in the finals.

3
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:18,645
You know, if it weren't for John, our best player, leaving the game because of a sprained ankle, we could've won the whole thing.

4
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:21,845
By the way, why didn't you guys compete?

5
00:00:22,155 --> 00:00:23,945
We were expecting to play you guys.

6
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:28,185
W: Oh, our manager Susan is not a very big fan of baseball.

7
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:32,585
She thinks that it's a waste of time spending our weekends playing sports.

8
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,125
M: You've got to be kidding.

9
00:00:34,685 --> 00:00:40,500
I can understand that she is not a big fan of baseball, but she should be thinking about the employees' morale.

10
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:45,285
I don't know about you guys, but our guys were all pumped up after the weekend game.

11
00:00:45,875 --> 00:00:49,385
I guess some of the bosses don't feel that company spirit is all that important.
